    <div class="prose reveal" data-reveal>
      <p>TPRS Glass is a trusted leader in the glass industry with over three decades of expertise, delivering innovative and standardized glass solutions across diverse sectors such as Architecture, Automotive, Vertical Mobility, White Goods, Locomotive, Refrigeration, Earthmovers, Marine, and Engineering. Built on the TREE values of Transparency, Responsibility, Efficiency, and Empowerment, TPRS stands apart through its strong commitment to sustainability, innovation, and excellence. TPRS Glass holds both domestic and international certifications, creating a perfect blend of advanced technology and unparalleled industry standards to meet the demands of today while remaining committed to sustainability and customer satisfaction.</p>
